      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Flag indicating that views from the default home screen (Intent.CATEGORY_HOME) may act as a handwriting delegator for the delegate editor view. If set, views from the home screen package will be trusted for handwriting delegation, in addition to views in the delegatorPackageName passed to acceptStylusHandwritingDelegation(View,String,int,Executor,Consumer).</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/inputmethod/InputMethodManager#HANDWRITING_DELEGATE_FLAG_HOME_DELEGATOR_ALLOWED" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.view.inputmethod.InputMethodManager.HANDWRITING_DELEGATE_FLAG_HOME_DELEGATOR_ALLOWED</code>.</a></format></para>
